{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/aysha-residence-eagle-hills-maryam-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":642,"crm_id":"362","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Aysha Residence","slug":"aysha-residence-eagle-hills-maryam-island","display_address":"Maryam Island","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Eagle Hills","price":2051888,"display_price":"2.05M","lattitude":25.324503,"longitude":55.361773,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Aysha Residences is a luxury 6-storey residential complex being developed by Eagle Hills, a major property developer known for its innovative projects across the globe. Located in the picturesque Maryam Island neighbourhood with beautiful city and sea views, Aysha Residences offers a high level of comfort and amenities to its residents.</p><p>The complex includes elegant <strong>studios and luxury 1-3 bedroom apartments</strong> equipped with state-of-the-art technology and stylish design.</p><p>Aysha Residence offers luxurious amenities:</p><ul><li>Swimming pool and spa centre</li><li>Fitness centre</li><li>Recreation and barbecue areas</li><li>Car park</li></ul><p>The complex also provides a high level of security with modern video surveillance and security systems.</p><p>The complex is favourably located close to the main road arteries, which provides quick access to the key places of the city and ease of movement. Expo Centre Sharja is just 5 minutes away, Sahara Centre Shopping Mall is 10 minutes away, Dubai International Airport is 15 minutes away and the University of Sharjah, Sharjah International Airport and Burj Khalifa are approximately 20 minutes away.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Aysha_Residence_by_Eagle_Hills_at_Maryam_Island_5d9b3b